<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - Dec 24.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - Dec 24.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   116/118   123/125     UNQ     238/241</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  126/127   132/135   231/245   255/262</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunkers were steady in thin talk on Christmas eve. Traders expected levels to remain steady although with most majors closing at midday, any urgent demand could be met by independents. Most sellers said prompt stocks were low and they only had supplies to offer for next week.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-0870-3082)</p>
